+- at 5,699: `PLATFORM_DD_BREACH` on the daily rule, while the engine's 2% sits at distance 0.53.
+
+The test also records `("all", "equity_floor")`: the absolute $9,000 floor halts any $6k account (GAP-P12D-56,
